" href="/encyclopedia/tunisia">Tunisia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1172</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abu-yaqub-yusuf-i">Abu Yaqub Yusuf I</a> absorbs the last independent Muslim principality of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/al-andalus">al-Andalus</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1195</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yaqub-al-mansur">Yaqub al-Mansur</a> crushes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alfonso-viii">Alfonso VIII</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-castile">Castile</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-alarcos">Battle of Alarcos</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1212</span><span class="rf-text">Christian coalition shatters the Almohad army at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-las-navas-de-tolosa">Las Navas de Tolosa</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1248</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-iii-of-castile">Ferdinand III of Castile</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seville">Seville</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1269</span><span class="rf-text">The last <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/idris-al-wathiq">Idris al-Wathiq</a>, is killed as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marinid-dynasty">Marinids</a> seize <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marrakesh">Marrakesh</a></span></li></ol>
